 "scope": [
  "Isolate P-103B electrically and per the isolation list; drain the casing.",
  "Record as-found shaft alignment; remove the coupling guard and spacer.",
  "Break the suction and discharge nozzle joints; remove the pump to the workshop.",
  "Replace the mechanical seal and the bearings; inspect the impeller and wear rings.",
  "Reinstall; new nozzle gaskets and studs tightened per SW-WO-5; align to the owner's alignment criteria.",
  "Remove blinds and isolations; run test."
